num(K,2,0,"A 14.4 V car alternator charges a 12 V battery (opposing) through 0.6 Ω in total. What is the charging current? Give amps.",4,"A","The net EMF drives current through the resistance.",["Net EMF = 14.4 − 12 = 2.4 V.","I = 2.4/0.6 = 4 A."])
